T("Smooths jagged edges of the game image before it is scaled to the window. SMAA: finds the edges and blends only along them, so textures stay sharp. Most useful at a lower internal resolution.", "在縮放到視窗之前平滑遊戲畫面的鋸齒邊緣。SMAA：找出邊緣並只沿邊緣混合，因此材質保持清晰。內部解析度較低時最有用。")
T("Asynchronous shaders", "非同步著色器")
T("Off: the game waits for each new shader to compile, a short stutter the first time an effect appears, and everything is drawn. On: no waiting, but what needs a shader still compiling is skipped meanwhile: effects pop in late, and pictures the game draws only once (the save file's screenshot) can come out as garbage.", "關：遊戲會等待每個新著色器編譯完成，效果首次出現時會短暫卡頓，但所有內容都會繪製。開：不等待，但需要仍在編譯中的著色器的內容會暫時略過：效果會延遲出現，遊戲只繪製一次的圖像（存檔的截圖）可能出現錯亂。")
